.Dd November 6, 2026
.Dt QBLOOM 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm qbloom
.Nd create, build, run, and test Qt Quick projects
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Cm init | in
.Ar name
.Op Fl -cpp | -rust | -go | -swift | -python | -java | -kotlin
.Op Fl -dir Ar path
.Op Fl -bridge Ar auto|native|ffi
.Op Fl -qt-dir Ar path
.Op Fl -no-git
.Op Fl -force
.Nm
.Cm override | ovr
.Ar name
.Op Fl -cpp | -rust | -go | -swift | -python | -java | -kotlin
.Op Fl -dir Ar path
.Op Fl -bridge Ar auto|native|ffi
.Op Fl -qt-dir Ar path
.Op Fl -no-git
.Op Fl -force
.Nm
.Cm add
.Ar name
.Op Fl -cpp | -rust | -go | -swift | -python | -java | -kotlin
.Op Fl -dir Ar path
.Op Fl -bridge Ar auto|native|ffi
.Nm Cm doctor Op Fl -json Op Fl -strict
.Nm Cm build Op Fl -release Op Fl -verbose
.Nm Cm run Op Fl -release Op Fl - Ar application-args ...
.Nm Cm test Op Fl -release Op Fl -headless
.Nm Cm clean
.Nm Fl -help
.Nm Fl -version
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
generates a Qt 6 / Qt Quick application with a backend-provided greeting
and a QML-bound counter.
The CLI is written in Swift; the backend flag selects the language of the
generated application's logic.
Run
.Cm doctor ,
.Cm build ,
.Cm run ,
.Cm test ,
and
.Cm clean
from the directory containing
.Pa qbloom.toml .
Scaffolding does not require an installed Qt SDK.
.Sh COMMANDS
.Bl -tag -width "override, ovr" -compact
.It Cm init , in Ar name
Create a new project directory.
The destination must not already exist.
The default backend is C++.
.It Cm override , ovr Ar name
Reset an existing
.Nm
.Cm init
project after a Y/N prompt.
The whole project, including user-added files, is replaced.
The full original project is moved to a sibling backup.
Projects created with
.Cm add
and unrelated directories are rejected.
.It Cm add Ar name
Add a separate
.Pa qbloom_quick
application to an existing CMake project and connect it to the top-level
.Pa CMakeLists.txt .
Existing source files are preserved.
Projects already containing
.Pa qbloom.toml
are rejected.
.It Cm doctor
Report required tools, versions, bridge, platform, and fixes.
.Fl -json
prints a machine-readable result with stable English status values and
remediation text.
.Fl -strict
returns an error when a required dependency is missing or incompatible;
an unverified-platform warning alone does not cause failure.
.It Cm build
Configure and build using the selected backend.
.Fl -release
selects a release build;
.Fl -verbose
passes verbose output to native build tools where available.
.It Cm run
Build as needed, then launch the application.
.Fl -release
selects a release build.
Arguments after
.Dq --
are passed to the application.
.It Cm test
Run backend tests and the available Qt Quick smoke test.
.Fl -headless
requests an offscreen Qt platform for GUI testing.
A smoke test that cannot run without a display may be skipped; inspect the
reported result.
.Fl -release
selects a release build where applicable.
.It Cm clean
Remove
.Pa .qbloom/build
from the current project.
.El
.Sh SCAFFOLDING OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width "-bridge auto|native|ffi" -compact
.It Fl -cpp , Fl -rust , Fl -go , Fl -swift , Fl -python , Fl -java , Fl -kotlin
Choose one backend.
The flags are mutually exclusive; omitting them selects C++.
.It Fl -dir Ar path
Use
.Ar path
as the parent directory; the default is the current directory.
.It Fl -bridge Ar auto|native|ffi
Choose an integration mode.
.Cm auto
selects the backend default.
C++, Python, and Rust accept
.Cm auto
or
.Cm native ;
Go, Java, Kotlin, and Swift accept
.Cm auto
or
.Cm ffi .
Unsupported combinations fail.
.It Fl -qt-dir Ar path
Currently rejected.
Set
.Ev CMAKE_PREFIX_PATH
when building with a custom Qt installation.
This option is only accepted syntactically by
.Cm init
and
.Cm override .
.It Fl -no-git
Accepted by
.Cm init
and
.Cm override ;
the current scaffolder does not initialize Git in either case.
.It Fl -force
Currently rejected.
Use
.Cm override
for a confirmed reset.
.El
.Sh ENVIRONMENT
.Bl -tag -width "UNICODE_PROGRESS_BAR" -compact
.It Ev LC_ALL , LC_MESSAGES , LANG
The CLI displays Korean guidance when the effective locale is
.Cm ko_KR ;
otherwise it uses English.
Native tools retain their own language.
.It Ev CMAKE_PREFIX_PATH , Qt6_DIR
Help CMake locate a custom Qt installation.
.It Ev QT_QPA_PLATFORM
Selects the Qt platform plugin.
.Cm test -headless
sets it to
.Cm offscreen
for the test process.
.It Ev UNICODE_PROGRESS_BAR
Set to
.Cm true
or
.Cm false
to control the build progress glyphs.
.It Ev NO_COLOR
Disable terminal color in CLI diagnostics.
.El
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width ".qbloom/build" -compact
.It Pa qbloom.toml
Generated project manifest, schema version 1.
It records the backend, bridge, Qt major version, and build directory.
.It Pa .qbloom/build
Build output removed by
.Cm clean .
.El
.Sh EXAMPLES
.Bd -literal -offset indent
qbloom init hello --python
cd hello
qbloom doctor --strict
qbloom build
qbloom run
qbloom test --headless

qbloom add existing-project --rust
qbloom override hello --cpp
.Ed
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Pa README.md ,
.Pa docs/installation.md ,
.Pa docs/manifest.md ,
.Pa docs/compatibility.md
in the qbloom source or release archive.
